        "reason": "Code does not import or catch RestError from @azure/core-rest-pipeline. SDK call errors in useWithKeyVault and useWithBlobStorage are caught as generic 'any' errors without statusCode inspection. Should catch RestError for service-specific error handling."
      },
      {
